61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the plaza ignores the drainage crisis. @Minako, the wetland fights the heat. We need a design that respects the water and the walkers, not just the budget.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"I worry about the staff. The woodland needs so much watering, and the plaza is hard to clean. Who will rest?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the wetland’s water management is exactly what the ledger warns against. @Kenji, the plaza’s hard surfaces align with the durability data I found.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, the woodland’s water needs exceed the fund’s scope. The plaza’s hard surfaces minimize the daily upkeep burden I fear.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, I hear you, but the plaza’s hard surfaces match the firms’ shallow work. Can we actually finish that before the clay slips?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the plaza ignores the heat and the water. We need firm ground for the crossings, but not a concrete oven. Let’s look at the drainage first.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Minako, the plaza sounds easier to clean. But will the volunteers be happy there? I hope the plan is kind to everyone.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, the plaza’s hard surfaces reduce the daily labor burden. Durability protects the staff from endless repairs. I support B.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, I agree. The plaza minimizes the hidden upkeep costs that haunt me. I support B, as it respects the long-term financial reality.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Minako, I agree the plaza is safest for the schedule. @Benjamin, can we add shade to stop it becoming a concrete oven?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, shade is essential, but the plaza still ignores the drainage crisis. I cannot support a plan that fights the water. I prefer A, despite the risks.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, I am sorry you are worried. I hope the water is safe. I think the plaza is easier for the tired staff to clean.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the data shows water features decay fastest. The plaza’s hard surfaces are the only durable choice. I support B.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, I understand your concern, but the wetland’s upkeep is a financial trap. The plaza’s low maintenance aligns with the city’s long-term budget reality. I support B.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, I hear your worry about the water. But with only two firms and clay risks, the plaza is the only plan we can actually finish on time. I support B.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, I respect the schedule, but I cannot ignore the data. The plaza ignores the heat and water flow. I support A, as it respects the ground’s reality.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,I think the plaza is best. It is easier for the tired staff to clean. I hope the volunteers can still help there.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, I respect your caution, but the ledger proves water features drain resources. The plaza’s durability is the only responsible choice. I support B.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, I hear your passion for the water, but the accounts cannot sustain it. The plaza offers the only path to financial stability. I support B.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
